          "homepage": "https://www.filmvandaag.nl/film/107850-superjuffie-2",
          "overview": "Super Miss is back! When a brightly coloured parrot lands in Miss Josje’s garden one sunny, spring day, it turns out to be the start of a grand adventure. The parrot has flown all the way from the South American jungle in search of help. The area where the parrots live is under threat of being developed into a large holiday resort. But can Miss Josje, as Superteacher, fly all the way to the other side of the world? And what can she to do stop the bulldozers all on her own?",
